    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd2c\ud83c\udf46 - <i>Get your ball to the end of each level...</i> \ud83d\ude34\ud83d\ude35\ud83d\ude31\ud83e\udd2f\ud83e\udd2a</h2>This is my first public game, and attempt at integrating Steamworks in a game. \ud83e\udd13<br><br><br>The game is about controlling a ball from start to finish on different levels, getting past the obstacles. \ud83e\udd73\ud83e\udd11!!1<br><br><strong><u>Only 3 very small levels so far - Do not expect much playtime atm.</u></strong> \ud83d\ude30\ud83d\ude29<br><br>Good Luck - Have Fun!<br><br><i><strong>This is an <u>Early Access</u> release, the game will progress along side of the development.</strong></i>\ud83d\ude32<br><br><strong>Features (Current\u2714\ufe0f and comming\u274c)</strong>:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Straightforward gameplay and physics \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li>Steam Achievements \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li>Steam Leaderboards \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li><strong><i>Steam Inventory:</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Trophies \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li>Ball Skins \u274c</li></ul></li></ul><br><strong>Caution</strong>:\ud83e\udd13\ud83d\ude2e<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This game is still very early stage - And might therefore have both bugs and glitches.\ud83e\udd27\ud83e\udd12<br></li><li><i><strong>Do NOT buy unless you are okay with that!</strong></i>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udfeb</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd2c\ud83c\udf46 - <i>Get your ball to the end of each level...</i> \ud83d\ude34\ud83d\ude35\ud83d\ude31\ud83e\udd2f\ud83e\udd2a</h2>This is my first public game, and attempt at integrating Steamworks in a game. \ud83e\udd13<br><br><br>The game is about controlling a ball from start to finish on different levels, getting past the obstacles. \ud83e\udd73\ud83e\udd11!!1<br><br><strong><u>Only 3 very small levels so far - Do not expect much playtime atm.</u></strong> \ud83d\ude30\ud83d\ude29<br><br>Good Luck - Have Fun!<br><br><i><strong>This is an <u>Early Access</u> release, the game will progress along side of the development.</strong></i>\ud83d\ude32<br><br><strong>Features (Current\u2714\ufe0f and comming\u274c)</strong>:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Straightforward gameplay and physics \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li>Steam Achievements \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li>Steam Leaderboards \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li><strong><i>Steam Inventory:</i></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Trophies \u2714\ufe0f<br></li><li>Ball Skins \u274c</li></ul></li></ul><br><strong>Caution</strong>:\ud83e\udd13\ud83d\ude2e<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This game is still very early stage - And might therefore have both bugs and glitches.\ud83e\udd27\ud83e\udd12<br></li><li><i><strong>Do NOT buy unless you are okay with that!</strong></i>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udfeb</li></ul>",
